Name: FocusYoutube (derived from Unhook)
Short Name: focus_youtube
URL: https://unhook.app/
Version: 1.6.9.1
License: Proprietary; modification and redistribution authorized in writing
License File: LICENSE.txt
Shipped: yes
Security Critical: yes

Description:
Built-in distraction controls for www.youtube.com and m.youtube.com in
Focus Browser. The packaged popup presents 24 essential controls on one
screen while the broader internal schema remains for profile compatibility.

Local Modifications:
Rebranded as FocusYoutube with a Russian, monochrome, browser-local 400x600
popup. No options page or external settings site is packaged. All individual
YouTube filters default to off while the component master switch defaults to
on. Account, license, premium, payment, analytics, remote font, donation,
feedback, welcome, uninstall and external update flows are not packaged.
Existing FocusYoutube profiles migrate locally without overwriting newer
values. The component performs no network requests.
The Focus Browser project owner retains the rightsholder's written permission
for this modification and distribution.
